## 1. `StudentClassController::index()` — remaining / session transform

**`PackageID` is not read anywhere in this flow.**  
Used counts come from `SessionDeductionService::batchObservedUsedSessions($classIds)` (per `StudentClassID` only). The transform then sets `UsedSessions` / `RemainingSessions` / `remaining_sessions` from each row’s `SessionCount` and that class’s observed usage.

Relevant earlier part (batch + start of transform):

```141:142:/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/StudentClassController.php
        $classIds = $classes->getCollection()->pluck('ID')->map(fn ($id) => (int) $id)->filter(fn ($id) => $id > 0)->values()->all();
        $observedUsedByClass = SessionDeductionService::batchObservedUsedSessions($classIds);
```

Full “remaining_sessions” section you asked about (no package branch):

```345:357:/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/StudentClassController.php
            $class->payment_type = ($class->ScheduleMode ?? 'count') === 'count' ? 'session' : 'monthly';
            $class->sessions_purchased = (int) ($class->SessionCount ?? 0);
            $observedUsedSessions = (int) ($observedUsedByClass[$class->ID] ?? 0);

            // Remaining = 購買堂數 − 實際已上（扣點、已完成堂次、已核准評量取最大後再與購買數取 cap）

            if ($class->sessions_purchased > 0) {
                $observedUsedSessions = min($class->sessions_purchased, $observedUsedSessions);
                $class->UsedSessions = $observedUsedSessions;
                $class->RemainingSessions = max(0, $class->sessions_purchased - $observedUsedSessions);
            }
            $class->sessions_used = (int) ($class->UsedSessions ?? 0);
            $class->remaining_sessions = (int) ($class->RemainingSessions ?? 0);
```

So **index does not use package-level remaining**; it is **per-course** (`SessionCount` vs per-`StudentClassID` observed usage).

