## 3. `StudentsList.vue` — `remaining_sessions` and packages

Display uses **`course.remaining_sessions`** and **`course.sessions_purchased`** like any other session course. The only package-specific UI called out in grep is the **「方案」** tag when `course.PackageID` is set; **remaining is not swapped for package pool**.

Example (session mode cell):

```237:247:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue
                      <td>
                        <div v-if="course.payment_type === 'session'" class="sessions-cell">
                          <div class="mini-progress">
                            <div class="mini-progress-fill" :style="{
                              width: Math.min(100, Math.round(((course.used_sessions || 0) / Math.max(course.sessions_purchased || 1, 1)) * 100)) + '%',
