## 5. `CoursePackagesPage.vue` — exists; what it shows

Path: `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CoursePackagesPage.vue`.

It is the **「多科共用方案」** page: filters, list of packages with **package-level** counters (`pkg.remaining_sessions`, `pkg.total_sessions`, `pkg.used_sessions`), badges (剩餘不足 / 堂數用完 / 已繳), expandable **members** (科目與老師), progress, actions (詳細、重算餘額、暫停等). Subtitle states shared pool deduction: **「堂數共用扣減」**.

